<% content_for :title, "Form Change" %>
<div class="mb-8">
  <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">Forms</p>
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">Form Change</h1>
  <p class="text-muted-foreground">
    Tracks whether a form has unsaved changes and dispatches events that other controllers can react to.
    Powers the <code class="text-xs bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">track_changes</code> option on <code class="text-xs bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Ui::ModalComponent</code>.
  </p>
</div>

<h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-3">Preview</h2>
<div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-background p-8 mb-8">
  <form data-controller="ui--form-change" id="fc-demo-form" class="w-full max-w-sm space-y-3">
    <div>
      <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground mb-1">Title</label>
      <input type="text" name="title" placeholder="Edit to trigger dirty state"
             class="block w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-background px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:border-transparent" />
    </div>
    <div>
      <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground mb-1">Body</label>
      <textarea name="body" rows="2" placeholder="Or edit this field…"
                class="block w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-background px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:border-transparent"></textarea>
    </div>
  </form>
  <div id="fc-status" class="hidden mt-4 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-warning">
    <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
      <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M8.485 2.495c.673-1.167 2.357-1.167 3.03 0l6.28 10.875c.673 1.167-.17 2.625-1.516 2.625H3.72c-1.347 0-2.189-1.458-1.515-2.625L8.485 2.495zM10 5a.75.75 0 01.75.75v3.5a.75.75 0 01-1.5 0v-3.5A.75.75 0 0110 5zm0 9a1 1 0 100-2 1 1 0 000 2z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
    </svg>
    Unsaved changes —
    <button onclick="document.getElementById('fc-demo-form').reset()"
            class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:no-underline">Reset</button>
  </div>
</div>
<script>
  (function() {
    var form = document.getElementById('fc-demo-form')
    var status = document.getElementById('fc-status')
    if (!form || !status) return
    form.addEventListener('ui--form-change:changed', function() { status.classList.remove('hidden') })
    form.addEventListener('ui--form-change:pristine', function() { status.classList.add('hidden') })
  })()
</script>

<h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-3">Usage</h2>
<div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-border mb-8">
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between bg-muted px-4 py-2">
    <span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">ERB</span>
    <button data-copy-target="#form-change-usage" class="text-xs text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition-colors">Copy</button>
  </div>
  <pre class="bg-card px-5 py-4 overflow-x-auto text-sm leading-relaxed" tabindex="0"><code id="form-change-usage" class="text-card-foreground"><%= h(example_form_change_usage) %></code></pre>
</div>

<h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-3">Events</h2>
<div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-border mb-8">
  <table class="w-full text-sm">
    <thead class="bg-muted">
      <tr>
        <th class="text-start px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-wider">Event</th>
        <th class="text-start px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-wider">Fires when</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody class="divide-y divide-border">
      <tr>
        <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs text-primary">ui--form-change:changed</td>
        <td class="px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground">Any input changes from its original value (form becomes dirty).</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs text-primary">ui--form-change:pristine</td>
        <td class="px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground">Form returns to its original state (reset or after successful submit).</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs text-primary">form:changed</td>
        <td class="px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground">Deprecated alias for <code class="text-xs bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">ui--form-change:changed</code>, fired alongside it. Removed in 0.4.0.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs text-primary">form:pristine</td>
        <td class="px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground">Deprecated alias for <code class="text-xs bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">ui--form-change:pristine</code>, fired alongside it. Removed in 0.4.0.</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
<p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-8">
  <code class="text-xs bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">form:changed</code> and
  <code class="text-xs bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">form:pristine</code> collide with anything a
  host names <code class="text-xs bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">form:*</code> itself; every other
  event the kit dispatches is namespaced <code class="text-xs bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">ui--&lt;identifier&gt;:&lt;event&gt;</code>.
  Listen for the namespaced pair — the unnamespaced one is deprecated and will stop firing in 0.4.0.
</p>

<h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-3">Public API</h2>
<ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground list-disc list-inside">
  <li><code class="text-xs bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">markDirty()</code> — manually mark the form dirty.</li>
  <li><code class="text-xs bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">markPristine()</code> / <code class="text-xs bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">reset()</code> — reset dirty state and capture new baseline.</li>
  <li><code class="text-xs bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">isDirty</code> getter — returns <code class="text-xs bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">true/false</code>.</li>
</ul>
